I suspect I know what your problem is...  The Gnomish Mines don't change much
in difficulty, so they take about the same level of ability to survive each
time.  If you are dying repeatedly, you are probably going there while you 
are still too weak.  I generally don't go there until I have:
a:  at least 50 hit points.
b:  a decent weapon.  (longsword or something similar)
c:  an AC no higher than three.
Of course, this is just a rule of thumb and one I freely alter if feel that
I have enough good stuff to compensate for any deficiencies in the above.
Just use your own judgement.

